#
# clang-tidy for the NIF shim (make lint-c). Only chappe_sip_engine_nif.c is
# checked; the vendored sofia-sip and the ERTS headers are not ours.
#
# Disabled, each for a reason:
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: every NIF and sofia callback takes
#     several pointers or ints of one type by contract; the check flags the
#     signatures, not a call that swaps them.
#   clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling:
#     asks for C11 Annex K (memcpy_s, snprintf_s), which glibc does not ship;
#     every memcpy in the shim is checked against its buffer instead.
#   misc-include-cleaner: wants a direct include for every symbol, including
#     those sofia's umbrella headers (sofia-sip/sip.h) define on purpose.
#
# cert-err33-c stays on: a bounded snprintf whose truncation is intended
# says so with a (void) cast.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  misc-*,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling,
  -misc-include-cleaner
WarningsAsErrors: '*'
HeaderFilterRegex: 'chappe_sip_engine_nif'
FormatStyle: none
